#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.read_odps_table.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.read\\_odps\\_table"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:1 of
msgid "Read an ODPS table into a LiteFrame with Arrow dtypes."
msgstr "使用 Arrow 数据类型将 ODPS 表读取到 LiteFrame 中。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:3 of
msgid ""
"The ODPS entry is resolved from the global context or environment "
"variables. Column names are normalized to be case-insensitive and dtypes "
"are derived from the ODPS table schema using the pyarrow backend."
msgstr ""
"ODPS 条目从全局上下文或环境变量中解析。列名被标准化为不区分大小写，并且"
"数据类型使用 pyarrow 后端从 ODPS 表模式中派生。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.read_odps_table.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:8 of
msgid "Name of the ODPS table to read."
msgstr "要读取的 ODPS 表的名称。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:10 of
msgid ""
"Partition specs to read (e.g. ``'pt=00'``). If None, all partitions are "
"read for partitioned tables."
msgstr ""
"要读取的分区规范（例如 ``'pt=00'``）。如果为 None，则对于分区表读取所有"
"分区。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:13 of
msgid ""
"Column names to select. Matching is case-insensitive. If None, all "
"columns are read."
msgstr "要选择的列名。匹配时不区分大小写。如果为 None，则读取所有列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:16 of
msgid ""
"Whether to include partition spec columns (e.g. ``pt`` for ``pt=00``) as "
"physical columns in the output. Automatically enabled when a partition "
"column is named explicitly in ``columns``."
msgstr ""
"是否将分区规范列（例如 ``pt=00`` 中的 ``pt``）作为物理列包含在输出中。当"
"在 ``columns`` 中明确命名分区列时自动启用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:21 of
msgid ""
"Index type for the resulting LiteFrame. If None, a default is chosen by "
"the backend."
msgstr "结果 LiteFrame 的索引类型。如果为 None，则由后端选择默认值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:24 of
msgid "Predicate filters to apply when reading the table."
msgstr "读取表格时应用的谓词过滤器。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:26 of
msgid "Additional keyword arguments forwarded to the reader."
msgstr "转发给读取器的附加关键字参数。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.read_odps_table.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:28 of
msgid ""
"A lazy LiteFrame with Arrow dtypes representing the ODPS table data. Call"
" ``.execute()`` to materialize the results."
msgstr ""
"一个使用 Arrow 数据类型表示 ODPS 表数据的惰性 LiteFrame。调用 ``.execute("
")`` 来实例化结果。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.read_odps_table.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:34 of
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.to_odps_table`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:35 of
msgid "Write a LiteFrame to an ODPS table."
msgstr "将 LiteFrame 写入 ODPS 表。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:37 of
msgid ":py:obj:`read_parquet`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datasource.read_odps_table.read_odps_table:38 of
msgid "Read a Parquet file into a LiteFrame."
msgstr "将 Parquet 文件读取到 LiteFrame 中。"

